      <span xmlns="http://www.w3.org/1999/xhtml" style="color:#000000;font-family:'Arial',sans-serif;font-size:10pt;font-weight:400;line-height:120%">This account contains offsetting entries related to interest &amp; dividend income from FPL&#8217;s nuclear decommissioning and storm special use funds which are held at an FPL subsidiary (KPB). These earnings which are recognized at the FPL subsidiary and reflected in Account 418.1 Equity in Earnings of Subsidiary Companies are offset in Account 419, resulting in no net income impact to FPL.</span>
    </link:footnote>
